{"title":"Best films of 2026","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/973016627/0/marginalrevolution~Best-films-of.html","date":1794721093000,"content":"<p>I thought this was a splendid and highly innovative year.  Here is my list, in the order I saw them, noting that a link typically brings you to my review:</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/01/resurrection.html\" target=\"_blank\">Resurrection</a></p>\r\n<p>Testament of Ann Lee</p>\r\n<p>28 Years Later</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/02/wuthering-heights-the-movie.html\" target=\"_blank\">Wuthering Heights</a></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/03/sirat.html\" target=\"_blank\">Sirat</a></p>\r\n<p>Project Hail Mary</p>\r\n<p>A Man on the Run</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/04/the-drama-no-spoilers.html\" target=\"_blank\">The Drama</a></p>\r\n<p>The Blue Trail</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/05/silent-friend.html\" target=\"_blank\">Silent Friend</a></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/06/the-pressure-no-spoilers.html\" target=\"_blank\">The Pressure</a></p>\r\n<p>Blue Heron</p>\r\n<p>The Invite</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/07/the-odyssey-the-movie-no-real-spoilers.html\" target=\"_blank\">The Odyssey</a></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/08/finding-emily.html\" target=\"_blank\">Finding Emily</a></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/10/what-ive-been-reading-297.html\" target=\"_blank\">You Can See Everything</a></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/11/fjord-and-fatherland.html\" target=\"_blank\">Fjord</a></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/11/fjord-and-fatherland.html\" target=\"_blank\">Fatherland</a></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/11/godzilla-minus-zero-no-spoilers.html\" target=\"_blank\">Godzilla: Minus Zero</a></p>\r\n<p>Queen at Sea</p>\r\n<p>What else?  <em>La Bola Negra</em> has good reviews but I have not seen it yet.  <em>Confession</em> is receiving raves.  Of those listed, <em>Sirat</em> would be my definite favorite, big screen required of course.</p>\r\n<p>I will give you an update for the rest of the year later in December, noting that anything appearing on Dec.31 in LA and NYC counts as 2027 for me.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/11/best-films-of-2026.html\">Best films of 2026</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/973016627/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/973016627/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/973016627/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblit